REQUIRES: cmake-ninja
XFAIL: system-darwin

A build under catter leaves Ninja's dependency records as a direct build
does: building again right after has nothing to do.
Known failures: #115 (dyld kills Apple's arm64e tools).

RUN: %e2e prepare hello %t
RUN: cmake -S %t -B %t/build -G Ninja
RUN: %catter script::cdb -q -o %t/compile_commands.json -- cmake --build %t/build
RUN: cmake --build %t/build | FileCheck %s

CHECK: no work to do
